Insulink app — licensing and provenance
=======================================

The app as a whole is conveyed under the **GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3** (`LICENSE`).

It moved from GPL-3.0 to AGPL-3.0 when the Omnipod DASH driver was added: that
driver is derived from AndroidAPS, which is AGPL-3.0, and AGPL-3.0 is the only
licence under which the combined work can be distributed.

